[N 58-60 Scholomance]
[NX 58-60 The Shapers Terrace]

Scholomance sits under the keep on Caer Darrow, the island in Darrowmere Lake in the south-east of the Western Plaguelands. Walk onto the island, go through the keep's courtyard to its back wall, and the crypt door there is the instance portal. You need the Skeleton Key to open the door inside (Dungeon Quest Atlas attunement item 13704, Attune key graph); this guide walks the key chain for both factions first. Most dungeon quests need level 55 to 57; the key chain starts at level 50.

-- Left out: 5342 and 5344 The Last Barov: each sends you to kill the other faction's Barov brother inside an enemy camp (Wowhead tooltips https://nether.wowhead.com/forever/tooltip/quest/5342 and /5344: assassinate Weldon at Chillwind Camp, or Alexi at the Bulwark); a world-PvP raid, not a dungeon quest.
-- Left out: 5461 to 5465 (The Human, Ras Frostwhisper to Soulbound Keepsake): no guide carries it yet (a Caer Darrow - Stromgarde round trip; only 5463 touches Stratholme). 5466 below needs them done. To add it later: carry 5461-5465 here as an optional block and map-check the Caer Darrow - Stromgarde (Arathi) legs.
-- Left out: 4734, 4735 (Tinkee Steamboil's egg chain): the Upper Blackrock Spire guide carries it and gives 5522, which this guide turns in. 5531 and 4771 below need 5522 in your log (QuestieDB: 5531 needs 5522, 4771 needs 5531).
-- Left out: 7629 Imp Delivery (Warlock), 7647 Judgment and Redemption (Paladin), 7668 and 8258 The Darkreaver Menace (Shaman): class-mount chains that start in the Burning Steppes, Stormwind and Orgrimmar and only visit Scholomance for one fight.
-- Left out: 8969 and 8992 (Valthalak amulet pieces, Bodley in Blackrock Mountain): the dungeon-set upgrade chain, which only passes through Scholomance.

